{
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "begin",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "So you're the new hand at my Anvil. The Cinder Mines won't clear themselves: take that old sword and head down.",
      "objective": "Delve",
      "highlight": "hub.delve",
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-walk",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "Mind your footing down here. Stretch your legs first: walk over to that beacon.",
      "objective": "Walk to the beacon with {input:move}",
      "marker": "walk",
      "trigger": { "type": "marker", "filter": { "id": "walk" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-rats",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "Rats! Don't bother swinging: your blade strikes on its own whenever a foe's in reach.",
      "objective": "Clear out the rats",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "kill", "filter": { "kind": "normal" }, "count": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-mana",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "See that blue bar filling up? Every hit you land feeds your mana, and your skills spend it.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "highlight": "hud.vitals",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-weapon",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "Something dropped! Materials fly to you on their own, but gear you walk over. It's yours to keep.",
      "objective": "Pick up the weapon",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "pickup", "filter": { "dropKind": "item" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-exit",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "That's the floor done. The gate's open: step through when you're ready.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-equip",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "Between depths you get one power-up. Better weapons carry more skills, and that blade carries a Primary. Put it on.",
      "objective": "Take Equip",
      "highlight": "stop.powerup",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["equip"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "takeStop", "filter": { "kind": "equip" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-door",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d1-1",
      "line": "Now pick a door. Only one road for now: the Winding Path.",
      "objective": "Take the Winding Path",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["equip"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-cast",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "Your new blade carries {primarySkill}. Let's see it: cast it at a rat.",
      "objective": "Cast with {input:primary}",
      "highlight": "hud.primary",
      "gate": { "door": 0 },
      "trigger": { "type": "cast", "filter": { "slot": 0 }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-chain",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "Press again before the chain cools: each move of a chain lands harder than the last.",
      "objective": "Cast the chain's second move with {input:primary}",
      "highlight": "hud.primary",
      "gate": { "door": 0 },
      "trigger": { "type": "cast", "filter": { "slot": 0, "step": 1 }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-aim",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "That slinger's keeping its distance. Hold {input:primary}, line it up with {input:aim}, and let go.",
      "objective": "Aim a cast at the slinger",
      "highlight": "hud.primary",
      "gate": { "door": 0 },
      "trigger": { "type": "cast", "filter": { "slot": 0, "aimed": true }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-dodge",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "See that brute winding up? When the ground under its slam glows, get out of the way.",
      "objective": "Dodge with {input:dodge}",
      "highlight": "hud.dodge",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "dodge", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-perfect",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "Now cut it fine: dodge just as the slam lands. A perfect dodge gives the charge back, and your next hit crits.",
      "objective": "Perfect-dodge the slam with {input:dodge}",
      "highlight": "hud.dodge",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "skipAfter": 5,
      "trigger": { "type": "perfectDodge", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-fog",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "Rooms stay dark until you see into them. The map in the corner remembers every place you've been.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "highlight": "hud.minimap",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-chest",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "A vault chest! Crack it open: chests are full of things for the forge.",
      "objective": "Open the chest with {input:interact}",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "interact", "filter": { "interactable": "chest" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-shrine",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "A shrine. Stand still while you pray and it'll bless you, for this floor or the whole dive.",
      "objective": "Pray at the shrine with {input:interact}",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "interact", "filter": { "interactable": "shrine" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-exit2",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "Good work. On to the exit.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-move",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "That chest gave you Mana Dust. Spend a little here: change one move of a chain however you like.",
      "objective": "Take Adjust a move",
      "highlight": "stop.powerup",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["move"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "takeStop", "filter": { "kind": "move" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-door",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d1-2",
      "line": "One more depth, then home.",
      "objective": "Take the Winding Path",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["move"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-den",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-3",
      "line": "An elite den. Its doors seal once you're in, and elites hit hard. If your life runs low, drink a potion.",
      "objective": "Drink a potion with {input:potion}",
      "highlight": "hud.potion",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "potion", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-rune",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-3",
      "line": "A rune! Walk over it. We'll set it in your blade back at the Anvil.",
      "objective": "Pick up the rune",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "pickup", "filter": { "dropKind": "rune" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1-exit3",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d1-3",
      "line": "That den won't trouble anyone again. Head for the exit.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-home",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d1-3",
      "line": "Time to come home. Extract and everything the dive banked is yours. Die down there and you lose the floor's haul and a share of the rest.",
      "objective": "Extract",
      "highlight": "stop.risk",
      "stop": { "kinds": [], "doors": [], "extract": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "extract", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-claim",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Welcome back! Quests pay out here at the Anvil: claim what you finished.",
      "objective": "Claim your completed quests",
      "highlight": "quests.claim",
      "trigger": { "type": "claim", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-forge",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Now the fun part. Forge a cuirass: its pattern, a Rusty bar, uncommon flux, and that shard from the chest.",
      "objective": "Forge an uncommon cuirass",
      "highlight": "hub.tab.forge",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "forge",
        "filter": { "slot": "chest", "rarity": "uncommon" },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-equip",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "See the ▲ on it? It beats what you're wearing. Put it on.",
      "objective": "Equip the cuirass",
      "highlight": "loadout.equip",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "equip",
        "filter": { "slot": "chest", "rarity": "uncommon" },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-bind",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "One element's a start. Bind a second: {partner} pairs nicely with {primary}, but pick whichever you like.",
      "objective": "Bind a second element",
      "highlight": "mana.bind",
      "trigger": { "type": "bind", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-skills",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Let's build your Primary. Add a slot, set the new move to {secondary}, open a socket on the first move, set the rune in it, then Apply.",
      "objective": "Add a slot, set {secondary}, socket the rune, Apply",
      "highlight": "skills.addSlot",
      "trigger": { "type": "setChains", "filter": { "moves": 3 }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-salvage",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "That old sword's done its job. Salvage it: it melts down into scrap and parts.",
      "objective": "Salvage the old sword",
      "highlight": "loadout.salvage",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "salvage",
        "filter": { "slot": "weapon", "rarity": "common" },
        "count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-refine",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Three Rusty bars make one Iron bar, and better bars forge deeper gear.",
      "objective": "Refine an Iron bar",
      "highlight": "forge.refine",
      "trigger": { "type": "refine", "filter": { "metal": "iron" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l1-claim2",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "More quests done. Claim them before you go.",
      "objective": "Claim your completed quests",
      "highlight": "quests.claim",
      "trigger": { "type": "claim", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "delve-2",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "That's the Anvil. Back down you go, and watch how {primary} and {secondary} play together.",
      "objective": "Delve",
      "highlight": "hub.delve",
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-pips",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-1",
      "line": "Every hit leaves its element on a foe: the pips under it. Land {primary} and {secondary} on the same foe and they react.",
      "objective": "Set off {reaction}",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "reaction", "filter": { "pair": true }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-reaction",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-1",
      "line": "That's {reaction}! Every pair of elements sets off its own, whichever lands first.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-exit1",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-1",
      "line": "Off you go. The exit's open.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-upgrade",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-1",
      "line": "A power-up you'll see often: upgrade a piece of gear for scrap.",
      "objective": "Take Upgrade",
      "highlight": "stop.powerup",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["upgrade"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "takeStop", "filter": { "kind": "upgrade" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-door",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-1",
      "line": "Onward.",
      "objective": "Take the Winding Path",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["upgrade"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-five",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-2",
      "line": "Let's make a habit of it: five more {reaction}s and this gate opens.",
      "objective": "Set off {reaction} five times",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "skipAfter": 120,
      "trigger": { "type": "reaction", "filter": { "pair": true }, "count": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-exit2",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-2",
      "line": "Now you're cooking. To the exit.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-power",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-2",
      "line": "Your pick this time: a new slot for a chain, or a move changed.",
      "objective": "Take a power-up",
      "highlight": "stop.powerup",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["slot", "move"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "takeStop", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-door",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-2",
      "line": "Onward.",
      "objective": "Take the Winding Path",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": ["slot", "move"], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-alcove",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-3",
      "line": "An anvil alcove! My kin leave them down here: use it for one power-up mid-floor.",
      "objective": "Use the anvil with {input:interact}",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "alcove": { "kinds": ["upgrade"] },
      "trigger": { "type": "interact", "filter": { "interactable": "alcove" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-exit3",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-3",
      "line": "Handy, aren't they? To the exit.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-doors",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-3",
      "line": "Two roads this time. A door changes the depth behind it: a calm shrine, or tunnels swarming with weaker foes. Neither skips a depth.",
      "objective": "Choose a door",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": [], "doors": ["shrine", "swarm"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-push",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-4",
      "line": "A short one. Foreman Grask waits below, so keep a potion handy.",
      "objective": "Reach the exit",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-door",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-4",
      "line": "Grask's hall is just below. Catch your breath, then go.",
      "objective": "Face Foreman Grask",
      "highlight": "stop.doors",
      "stop": { "kinds": [], "doors": ["winding"], "extract": false },
      "trigger": { "type": "reachDepth", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-grask",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-5",
      "line": "Foreman Grask! Mind his slam, dodge what he throws, and keep your chain going.",
      "objective": "Defeat Foreman Grask",
      "trigger": { "type": "boss", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-rare",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-5",
      "line": "He dropped a rare weapon. Rares carry the Defensive skill too: grab it.",
      "objective": "Pick up the weapon",
      "gate": { "exit": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "pickup", "filter": { "dropKind": "item" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-exit5",
      "where": "floor",
      "floor": "d2-5",
      "line": "The Cinder Mines are yours. Head out.",
      "objective": "Take the exit with {input:interact}",
      "trigger": { "type": "clearFloor", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-home",
      "where": "stop",
      "floor": "d2-5",
      "line": "No power-up this time: that weapon rides home whole. Extract.",
      "objective": "Extract",
      "highlight": "stop.extract",
      "stop": { "kinds": [], "doors": [], "extract": true },
      "trigger": { "type": "extract", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-compare",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Look at Grask's weapon. As it comes it's no match for yours, but the ◇ says it's a better home for the moves you've built.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "highlight": "loadout.compare",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-transfer",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "So move your moveset onto it. Your slots and your socket come along, for a little scrap.",
      "objective": "Transfer your moveset",
      "highlight": "loadout.transfer",
      "trigger": { "type": "transfer", "filter": { "rarity": "rare" }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-hone",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "On the Temper bench you can hone a line: it rolls its value again within its band.",
      "objective": "Hone a line",
      "highlight": "temper.hone",
      "trigger": { "type": "hone", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-claim",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "Claim what you finished down there.",
      "objective": "Claim your completed quests",
      "highlight": "quests.claim",
      "trigger": { "type": "claim", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-board",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "And this is the Contract board: three jobs at a time, fresh ones after every dive that clears a depth.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "highlight": "quests.board",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-train",
      "where": "training",
      "line": "Your rare carries a Defensive skill. Try it on my dummies in the Training Grounds.",
      "objective": "Cast your Defensive with {input:defensive}",
      "highlight": "hub.training",
      "trigger": { "type": "cast", "filter": { "slot": 1 }, "count": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "l2-bye",
      "where": "anvil",
      "line": "That's all I've got. Rares can be awakened to carry an Ultimate, and epics carry one already. Go find out. The Anvil's always here.",
      "objective": "Continue",
      "beat": true,
      "trigger": { "type": "ack", "count": 1 }
    }
  ],
  "partners": {
    "fire": "frost",
    "frost": "fire",
    "storm": "fire",
    "earth": "frost",
    "shadow": "earth",
    "nature": "fire"
  },
